# Rolling on the flat, Down then Up starts a nose manual on its own; ollie out and land banks it.
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
hold up 0..80
tap down 100
tap up 104
hold ollie 200..220
bot balance
run 420
expect event manualStart{trick=Nose Manual} within 104..106
expect event comboLanded{name=Nose Manual} within 300..400
expect no event bail
